# Agent worktrees: separate checkouts of THIS repo that agents run in.
# They live inside the project, so without this every tool that walks the tree
# (git, eslint, prettier, the vite watcher) would treat a second copy of the
# whole codebase as new files in this one.
.claude/worktrees/
